      "mergeID": "63aac503c1d6a369efbae3e6",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Repro Steps:\n\n1. Open a world project.\n\n2. Go to the SDK window and enter any number above 1 in the \"Number of clients\" field.\n\n3. Press \"Build and Test\"\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nThe requested number of clients launch.\n\nActual Behavior:\n\nOne client launches and a alert pops up wit the following error:\n\n\"Only a single instance of Easy Anti-Cheat launcher is allowed to run at any given time\"\n\nThis makes it very difficult to test network-synced udon.\n\nUsing the latest SDK from the VCC (3.1.10)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "EAC prevents launching multiple test clients from SDK",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62f7967926ea1a59d80caf64",
