      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Within the VRChat SDK Control Panel > Settings there should be an option to set the VRChat client path, what is it set to currently? If it is not set to be VRChat.exe it'll launch with EAC causing the issue above. (When local testing worlds the client doesn't need EAC)",
